  "2026-07-31T20:35:16.446Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,"Measured final pre-PR diagnostics: validate:release passed; portable Vitest 963 passed with one intentional skip; four-metric coverage is 41.69% statements, 42.07% branches, 52.09% functions, and 41.41% lines; compiled live read-only acceptance passed 183/183; Bun/npm audits and tracked/history secret scans passed; jscpd remains red at 8.09% duplicated lines and 220 clones, with no new clone from this bundle after removing a redundant assertion. Coverage and zero-duplication remain canonical open jf-mkzh/jf-lpki work."
  "2026-07-31T20:40:56.439Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,"PM-native linked validation passed on 2026-07-31: portable coverage suite 963 passed/1 intentional skip; full release validation passed; compiled CLI live read-only E2E against Jellyfin 10.11.11 passed 183/183; focused OpenAPI contract/schema suite passed 31/31. Process TMPDIR was moved under ~/.cache because host /tmp was inode-exhausted; no private values or live payloads were stored in PM evidence."
  "2026-07-31T20:43:31.910Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,"Pre-commit contract review corrected OpenAPI parameter precedence: operation-level parameters now override matching path-level parameters in routing and rich metadata, per OpenAPI semantics. Focused suite remains 31/31; TypeScript typecheck, ESLint, and diff whitespace checks pass."
  "2026-07-31T20:46:06.248Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,"Opened PR #47 at exact implementation head de99432 with PM link, privacy boundary, latest Jellyfin 10.11.11 compatibility evidence, automatic-release dry run, live read-only E2E, packaging, security, and measured repository-wide coverage/duplication disclosures."
  "2026-07-31T20:58:10.157Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,"PR #47 review round 1: CodeRabbit findings accepted. Removed the machine-specific TMPDIR from current linked tests and used audited pm history-redact to sanitize its prior append-only event with verified hashes. Consolidated path/operation parameter precedence into one exported typed resolver shared by execution and inspection. Typecheck, ESLint, 31 focused tests, and strict PM validation pass. Gemini and Sourcery were unavailable; CodeRabbit rate-limited its full run after posting findings."
