plan_mode: executing
plan_scope: "Official and live 10.11.11 OpenAPI contract extraction, agent-ready jf api inspect output, exact argument templates, schema-valid formats, docs, behavior tests, read-only live acceptance, and production PR closeout."
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: "Latest stable and configured server are Jellyfin 10.11.11. Generic exact operation execution already exists, but inspect only exposes parameter names/requiredness and body content types, forcing agents to guess types, enums, defaults, schemas, security, responses, and CLI construction. Preserve owner-only credentials and use JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 for live proof."
plan_validation[1]{text,command,expected}:
  "Complete release validation passed; exact portable coverage remains below the governed repository target; zero-duplication remains red without any clone introduced by this bundle; compiled live read-only suite passed all 183 commands; dependency and secret audits are clean; strict PM validation, graph audit, and duplicate scan pass after refreshing the merge fence.","bun run validate:release; bun run test:coverage:four; bun run check:duplicates; JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 JELLYFIN_E2E_USE_DIST=1 bun test tests/e2e/cli.test.ts; pm --no-extensions validate ... --strict-exit",Release and live gates pass; canonical project-wide coverage and duplication debt remains honestly open.
plan_decisions[2]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-31T20:20:51.509Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,Extend exact operation inspection instead of adding a duplicate catalog or dry-run command.,jf schema openapi already catalogs operations and jf api batch --dry-run already plans execution. The non-duplicative gap is complete per-operation invocation metadata at the exact execution boundary.,"Current command/help/source inspection and all-status PM search across jf-0ea5, jf-lyq6, and jf-axko."
  "2026-07-31T20:34:56.476Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,Refresh the repository PM merge fence with the latest CLI installer.,"Strict storage validation detected stale per-type JSON mapping and missing wildcard TOON, Markdown, and JSON rules after the PM CLI upgrade.",pm merge install --dry-run produced a deterministic .gitattributes-only update; pm merge install applied it and configured clone-local drivers.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:20:50.798Z",codex-jellyfin-contracts,"The configured Jellyfin 10.11.11 live schema exposes 429 operations across 356 paths, including plugin extensions; intent mapping reports 100 percent but jf api inspect currently exposes only names, requiredness, and body content types. OpenAPI parameter schemas, request schemas, response contracts, security requirements, and executable argument templates are omitted."
